<title>LUXEMBOURG: Luxembourg yr/yr inflation 1.04 pct in April.</title>
<headline>Luxembourg yr/yr inflation 1.04 pct in April.</headline>
<dateline>LUXEMBOURG 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Luxembourg Statistics Office released the following data -</p>
<p>    LUXEMBOURG CONSUMER PRICES *  April	March	April 96</p>
<p>    Index (base 100=1996)	 100.87     100.85	99.83</p>
<p>    Mth/mth change (in pct)	+0.02	-0.19	+0.22</p>
<p>    Yr/yr change (in pct)	  +1.04	+1.24	  n/a</p>
<p>NOTE - * index as measured on the first of the month.</p>
<p>Statec said the near stability in Luxembourg inflation on April 1 was due mainly to a seasonal, 10 percent decline in the cost of cut flowers. The cost of combustible fuels also fell by more than three percent. Price increases were reported for potatoes, air travel, coffee and shoe repair.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
